  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　……ああ、お店の話か\r\nはは、新譜が入ってくる日なら、わくわくするだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0328"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0242",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 1024001000410020,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "うわー、わかってない感がやばいですよ！\r\n新譜の箱を開ける時って、本当にめっちゃ最高で…………！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_excite",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/102400100041/1024001000410020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024001000410030,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "指紋の付いてない、つるっつるのパッケージが並んでて\r\nそこに『特典あります』ってシールつけて────",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_excite",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0220",
    "voice": "produce_communications/102400100041/1024001000410030"
  },
  {
    "select": "わかるよ、\r\nちょっと",
    "nextLabel": "1024001000411"
  },
  {
    "select": "店員さんの\r\n鑑みたいだ",
    "nextLabel": "1024001000412"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "毎度ありがとう\r\nございます",
    "nextLabel": "1024001000413"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024001000410040,
    "label": "1024001000411",
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "あははっ、ほんとですか！！　お店行くの待ち遠しくて！\r\n聴きたかったサンプルとか、販促物もがっつり入ってきて！",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0327",
    "voice": "produce_communications/102400100041/1024001000410040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024001000410050,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "あーこれこんなちょっとしかオーダーしなかったんだーとか\r\n全部私が売ってやるー！！　とかってすごい高まって──",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_excite",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/102400100041/1024001000410050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、うん。そういうお店の人の体験談を聞くとさ\r\n俺ももっともっと頑張らなきゃって、思えるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0328"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "1024001000412",
